%%% T03 Issue #3 — predict() 端到端调用链（Mermaid sequenceDiagram）
%%% 源码基线：stable-baselines3 commit 7cfb4dd
%%% 建议在 VS Code 里装 Mermaid 预览插件，或复制到 mermaid.live 渲染为 PNG/SVG
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户脚本
    participant BA as BaseAlgorithm.predict<br>(common/base_class.py:536)
    participant BP as BasePolicy.predict<br>(common/policies.py:331)
    participant BP_OTT as BaseModel.obs_to_tensor<br>(common/policies.py:236)
    participant ACP_P as ActorCriticPolicy._predict<br>(common/policies.py:709)
    participant ACP_GD as ActorCriticPolicy.get_distribution<br>(common/policies.py:743)
    participant FE as features_extractor<br>(BaseModel.extract_features L122)
    participant MLP as mlp_extractor.forward_actor<br>(ActorCriticPolicy L751)
    participant AN as action_net + CategoricalDistribution<br>(L691 / L697)
    participant CD as CategoricalDistribution<br>.get_actions(det=True)
    participant ENV as Gymnasium Env.step()

    Note over U,ENV: 本图主链仅为 PPO / CartPole / MlpPolicy 的单观测确定性预测
    U->>U: obs, info = env.reset()<br># shape=(4,) for CartPole
    Note over U: 注意 tuple (obs,info)<br>不要直接喂给 model.predict()
    U->>BA: model.predict(obs, deterministic=True)
    BA->>BP: self.policy.predict(obs, None, None, det=True)
    BP->>BP: set_training_mode(False)<br>关 dropout / BN
    BP->>BP: 若 obs 是 tuple(obs, info) → 抛 ValueError<br>(tests/test_predict.py test_mixing_gym_vecenv_api L121)
    BP->>BP_OTT: obs → obs_tensor + vectorized?
    BP_OTT-->>BP: obs_tensor shape=(1,4),<br>vectorized=False
    BP->>ACP_P: with th.no_grad():<br>self._predict(obs_tensor, det=True)
    ACP_P->>ACP_GD: self.get_distribution(obs_tensor)
    ACP_GD->>FE: extract_features(obs, pi_features_extractor)
    FE-->>ACP_GD: features shape=(1, feature_dim)
    ACP_GD->>MLP: forward_actor(features)
    MLP-->>ACP_GD: latent_pi shape=(1, 64)
    ACP_GD->>AN: action_net(latent_pi) → logits
    AN-->>ACP_GD: distribution = Categorical(logits)
    ACP_GD-->>ACP_P: distribution
    ACP_P->>CD: .get_actions(deterministic=True)
    CD-->>ACP_P: actions shape=(1,) (int64),<br>deterministic=True 即 argmax(probs)<br>与 logits 的 argmax 一致
    ACP_P-->>BP: actions Tensor
    BP->>BP: actions.cpu().numpy().reshape((-1, *action_space.shape))
    Note over BP: 本例 Discrete 不执行 Box 后处理。<br>补充：其他 Box 配置按 squash_output 选择 unscale 或 clip，<br>其前面的动作分布不使用本图的 Categorical。
    BP->>BP: vectorized=False → squeeze(batch) → shape=()
    BP-->>BA: final_action ndarray scalar + state=None
    BA-->>U: (action, state)
    U->>ENV: env.step(int(action))
    ENV-->>U: new_obs, reward, terminated, truncated, info
